"metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幻想乡境内博丽神社的现有巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"博丽神社是专门守护幻想乡不可缺少的大结界的神社。博丽的巫女代代以解决异变为事业。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是历代巫女中最缺乏危机感的一位，不知是因为修行不足，还是因为已经拥有足够的实力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她天生地幸运和敏锐，也退治了不少妖怪。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"主要是在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"作为博丽巫女的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"操纵灵气的程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f33007c417ade7c73b7ee78244285c2ff601da86919605a6f56c0570deb01c0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc26d83763ce8144e0a342eaeb5a41bf3e1756ec782d0268170ef9bac39c8489.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_486","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"霧雨魔理沙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"居住于魔法森林的人类魔法使，常骑着扫把，「霧雨店」的独生女。會使用魔法森林的蘑菇調製火藥，所使用的魔法幾乎只有把東西破壞的效果，而且燃料需要長時間準備，但是其效果非常強力，在Spell Card規則成立下，純粹的破壞力在人類當中屬於最高等級。此外在幻想乡是出了名的小偷，帕邱莉的图书馆、香霖堂，如果不是古明地觉会读心术，甚至连地灵殿都会惨遭毒手。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"使用魔法程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e00e4df671f5f80d5733c44e4b69596b901aad88177fc335789c2dd5ea6b2d6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3bd6c6ab5c1df20f216ccf8f7e1581841d4fed04fe2cad0f92ce726df7fb8d1.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_488","characterName":"知识与避世的少女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"知识与避世的少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大概有100岁的魔女，平常待在红魔馆里面的图书馆的知识分子，有气喘的毛病。擅长操纵七曜（火水木金土日月），名言是“凡物都有属性。所谓的属性，跟弱点是一样的东西”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Patchouli→广藿香（一种香草，因此她有“帕琪”“香草”一类的昵称），Knowledge→知识"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"魔女、魔法使"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"使用魔法程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"使用魔法（主要是属性）程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"使用魔法（主要是精灵魔法）的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"操纵火+水+木+金+土+日+月的程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b8493e88bcc7680de30e8b9e6e66890ad487612a220d97d4b7f4da9fa8fe97d9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de86334f8179285b5b96f03c533ec39d91050913e666646d4b78d3ba0862f3c0.webp","width":151,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:997","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:997","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:997","name":"上海アリス幻樂団","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-brand:5207:997","source":"egs"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","vndb-work-mapping-pending"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
